AC hum monitoring tool.

In summary, this listens to an ALSA PCM capture interface and holds a memory
buffer. If an event happens (flunctuation, brownout, or blackout), this utility
will automatically dump the in-memory buffer into the disk.

The goal of this project is to learn a little more on DSP and provide a
monitoring tool for power events. Needless to say, a laptop (or other
battery/UPS-powered device) should be used.

The code is in a bit of a rough shape, don't expect too much out of it.

